  "data":{"hardware":"8×NVIDIA A100 80GB HBM2eサーバとNVIDIA H200。Mixtral-176B end-to-endは4×A100、Qwen-14Bは単一A100。","software":"PyTorch 2.5.1、CUDA 12.1、SGLang、CUTLASS、DietGPU由来rANS。","methodology":"1.5B〜405B、dense/MoE、bf16〜int4/AWQ/SmoothQuantまで重みエントロピーとbitrateを測る。固定80GB/320GB容量で最大バッチ、tokens/s、TPOTを比較し、A100/H200で融合カーネルmicrobenchmarkを実施。","scope":"実GPU評価。重みは厳密に無損失だが、利得は重み容量がKV/バッチを制限するthroughput-oriented servingで大きい。","workloads":["Qwen-14B seq 1024/2048","Mixtral-176B seq 1024/2048","6モデルGEMM microbench"],"baselines":["CUTLASS","NeuZip","DFloat11","KTransformers"],"metrics":["bits/weight","weight memory","max batch","tokens/s","median TPOT","kernel throughput"]}
}

{
